==Battleground==
*6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A pretty straightforward but also aggressive angel and Teacher Bun Bun stage. Bringing anti angel units helps for the angel pushers, while bringing anti floating units helps for the Teacher Bun Bun. [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] with the Target Angel talent and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] are two strong examples, as Sanzo Cat can slow every threat on the stage while Cameraman Cat provides solid offense and additional defense through the survive lethal chance.

